 "view_limit": "The filterscope metadata nodes expose calibration and photon-flux signals, not a sightline/location field. Neither corpus attributes nor retained native-rate cache metadata identify divertor/midplane views. PMT mappings are verified tree aliases, not inferred geometry.",
 "auth_stopped": false,
 "filterscope_text_nodes": {
  "\\D3D::TOP.SPECTROSCOPY.FILTERSCOPE:GAIN_CALIB": "The numerical node GAIN_COEFFS contains the array \n[a1, b1, a2, b2, a2, b3, a4, b4] , where \neach pair of constants \"a\" and \"b\" are \nthe fit coefficients in the power law G = a V^b \nover the voltage ranges [.15-.35, .35-.50, .50-.70, .70-.90], respectively.\n\nIn the power law above, G is photomultiplier gain \nand V is dynode voltage. \n\nThe gain-corrected signal PHOTO_EL-SIG is related \nto the raw signal PMTxxyy by the relation: \n\nPHOTO_EL_SIG = PMTxxyy / G. ",
  "\\D3D::TOP.SPECTROSCOPY.FILTERSCOPE:PHOTON_FLUX": "The numerical node FLUX_CONSTS contains the eight constants \n[PMT, WAVE, BAND_CENTER, FWHM, INH_NO, LINE_CAL, V_CAL, GAIN_V], where \n\nPMT is the model number of the miniature Hamamatsu photomultiplier assembly, \nWAVE is the wavelength in Angstroms of the given spectra line, \nBAND_CENTER is the central wavelength in Angstroms of the bandpass filter, \nFWHM is the full width at half maximum in Angstroms of the bandpass filters transmission profile, \nINH_NO is the dot product of the Optronics light source intensity and the peak-normalized, filter transmission function \nLINE_CAL is the voltage response of the filterscope during calibration with the in-vessel light source, \nV_CAL is the control voltage at which LINE_CAL is measured, \nGAIN_V is the gain of the photomultiplier at the voltage V_CAL. \n\nThe calibrated photon flux, PHOTON_FLUX, [ (ph/s-ster-cm2)/volt ]\nis related to the photoelectron signal \nPHOTO_EL_SIG by the  relation: \n\nPHOTON_FLUX = ( INH_NO / LINE_CAL ) * GAIN_V * PHOTO_EL_SIG  ",
  "\\D3D::TOP.SPECTROSCOPY.FILTERSCOPE.NOTES:FLUX_CONSTS": "TreeNODATA: %TREE-E-NODATA, No data available for this node",
  "\\D3D::TOP.SPECTROSCOPY.FILTERSCOPE.NOTES:GAIN_COEFFS": "TreeNODATA: %TREE-E-NODATA, No data available for this node"
 },
